Wrong (B): $4.13 equals basic EPS ($620,000 / 150,000) and ignores the RSU dilution entirely.
Wrong (C): $3.88 overstates the incremental shares by not applying the treasury stock method buyback, effectively adding all 10,000 RSUs to the denominator.
