  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under GASB 34, capital assets are evaluated against the capitalization threshold individually when each unit functions independently. Each server costs $18,000, below the $25,000 threshold, and supports a different department, so all four are expensed.
Wrong (A): Grouping independently functioning assets to exceed the threshold is not permitted when each unit operates as a standalone item serving different departments.
